# PONDEROSA V3 default Ped-sim pedigree templates for simulation-based training.
#
# The copy count (second field) is rewritten at run time to
# training.n_pairs_per_relationship (default 100); every replicate gets a fresh
# draw of unrelated founders from the cohort (--set_founders).
#
# Template "full3gen": a founder couple (generation 1, printed), two branches of
# two full siblings each (generation 2), and one child of each reproducing
# generation-2 sibling (generation 3). Labelled pairs produced:
#   PO   (gen1-gen2, gen2-gen3)
#   FS   (all generation-2 siblings)
#   PGP / MGP (gen1-gen3, side determined by the sex of the gen-2 parent)
#   AV   (gen2 non-parent sibling - gen3)
#   CO   (first cousins, 3rd degree, gen3-gen3)
def full3gen 1 3
1 1
2 2 2
3 1

# Template "half3gen": one generation-1 individual has a child with each of two
# different founder spouses, giving half-siblings in generation 2; each half-sib
# has one child in generation 3. Labelled pairs produced:
#   PHS / MHS (side determined by the sex of the shared generation-1 parent)
#   PO, PGP / MGP
#   half-avuncular (3rd degree), half-first cousins (HCO, 4th degree)
def half3gen 1 3
1 1
2 1 2  1:1 2:1
3 1
